units metal
atom_style atomic/kk
boundary p p f
read_data SMALL_MODEL_INITIAL.data

mass 1 47.867
mass 2 28.085
mass 3 12.011
mass 4 107.8682

pair_style mliap/kk unified MACE_V17_MLIAP_RUNTIME.pt 0
pair_coeff * * Ti Si C Ag
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

thermo 1
thermo_style custom step pe
dump forces all custom 1 MACE_LAMMPS_KK_RUN0.dump id type x y z fx fy fz
dump_modify forces sort id
run 0
undump forces
